# 10. KittyTron — Joint Experimental Model

One of the flagship long-term research projects should be:

# KittyTron

KittyTron would combine discoveries from both model families.

It should **not** simply concatenate KittyLM and TweakTron.

Instead, KittyTron should emerge after experiments identify which techniques are worth combining.

Candidate components might eventually include:

```text
KittyLM research
    │
    ├── reproducibility
    ├── dataset pipeline
    ├── evaluation
    ├── agents
    └── systems integration

                 ┐
                 ├──► KITTYTRON
                 ┘

TweakTron research
    │
    ├── GDN
    ├── GDN2
    ├── FlashQLA
    ├── MoM
    └── architecture conversion
```

KittyTron therefore becomes a **research synthesis model**, not merely another checkpoint.

