# 15. MCP Security Lab

Because tool-connected AI introduces new attack surfaces, Kitty × Tweak Labs should maintain an **MCP Security Lab**.

Research questions:

- malicious tool responses
- prompt injection
- privilege escalation
- tool impersonation
- secret leakage
- unsafe filesystem access
- network restrictions
- sandbox escape prevention
- agent authorization models

This connects Kitty's cybersecurity studies directly with AI agent research.

