# 20. Kitty × Tweak Compute Fabric

The home lab should gradually evolve into a distributed compute environment.

Initial concept:

```text
                     KTL COMPUTE FABRIC

       ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
       │       Debian-Kitty Server       │
       │      Control / Services Node    │
       └──────────────┬──────────────────┘
                      │
                2.5/5/10 GbE
                      │
       ┌──────────────┼───────────────┐
       │              │               │
       ▼              ▼               ▼

 Kitty Workstation   Tweak Node    Future GPU Node
 RX 9060 XT          RTX 5050     High-VRAM GPU
 16 GB VRAM          Blackwell
       │
       ├──────── Raspberry Pi Nodes
       │
       ├──────── Storage / NAS
       │
       └──────── Edge Devices
```

The objective is eventually to treat the lab as **one compute environment instead of isolated PCs**.

