# 23. CrossSilicon

A dedicated project should exploit this hardware difference.

# CrossSilicon

Purpose:

Compare AI workloads across:

- AMD
- NVIDIA
- ROCm
- CUDA

Measurements:

- throughput
- latency
- VRAM
- wattage
- kernel support
- compilation
- numerical behaviour
- framework compatibility

This creates research that many single-vendor hobby labs cannot easily perform.

