# 35. Experiment Ledger

Every significant experiment should have a record.

Example:

```yaml
experiment: KTL-ATTN-0042
project: KittyLM
commit: abc123
model:
  parameters: 247M
  architecture: GDN2
tokenizer:
  vocab: 16384
dataset:
  version: ktldata-v0.4
  hash: ...
hardware:
  gpu: RX 9060 XT
training:
  precision: bf16
  seed: 42
results:
  validation_loss: ...
  tokens_per_second: ...
```

This eventually becomes one of the most valuable assets of the research lab.

