# 49. Hardware Acquisition Philosophy

Every purchase should answer:

> **Which experiment becomes possible because we bought this?**

Examples:

### RAM

Enables:

- larger datasets
- VMs
- compilation
- preprocessing

### NVMe

Enables:

- fast datasets
- model checkpoints
- training throughput

### HDD / NAS

Enables:

- archives
- model storage
- backups

### High-VRAM GPU

Enables:

- larger models
- fine-tuning
- training
- faster inference

### Raspberry Pi

Enables:

- edge inference
- ARM
- k3s
- distributed services

### Networking

Enables:

- shared datasets
- distributed workloads
- remote GPU execution

